OL,3,GNEWSA'An IRA boss wanted me dead - my
OL,4,Abest mate was killed beside me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe survivor of a notorious knife
OL,7,Fmurder that got the attention of the
OL,8,FWhite House has told his story on
OL,9,Ftelevision for the first time.
OL,11,FBrendan Devine's throat was slashed and
OL,12,Fhe suffered a severe stab wound to the
OL,13,Fabdomen in a 2005 attack involving
OL,14,Fmembers of the Provisional IRA.
OL,16,FHis friend Robert McCartney was killed.
OL,17,FIn the fallout McCartney's sisters and
OL,18,Ffiancee mounted a campaign for justice
OL,19,Fthat won support from US President
OL,20,FGeorge W Bush and the European
OL,21,FParliament.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
