OL,3,GNEWSA'An IRA boss wanted me dead - my
OL,4,Abest mate was killed beside me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the crime remains unsolved ` and in
OL,7,Fa new BBC documentary series Devine
OL,8,Ftells of his guilt over the way the
OL,9,Fattack unfolded, and for the failure to
OL,10,Fcatch the killers.
